description: Zentro API conventions and rules
alwaysApply: true
---

The instructions for this repository live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it — it is
the single source of truth for every AI tool used here, so there is nothing to keep in sync.

The rules most likely to cause real bugs, restated so they are never missed:

1. Money is `bigint` minor units plus an ISO-4217 code. Never a float. All arithmetic on
   amounts goes through `src/common/money/`.
2. Every group-scoped route is guarded **and** its query is scoped by membership. Non-members
   receive 404, never 403.
3. `synchronize` stays `false`. Schema changes go through a reviewed migration.
4. Never return a TypeORM entity from a controller — map to a response DTO.
5. Services are HTTP-blind: no `Request`, no `HttpException`. Throw domain errors.

Before touching anything ledger-related, read `docs/data-model.md`.
